        // AOT-fails today (undeclared 'rope') with the builtin STILL registered, and train_decoder_cpu_
        // c/d/b2 + train_7b (the only rope_inplace callers) ALREADY transpile-fail (builtin-independent).
        // compiler/** self-host closure has ZERO refs to either (byte-eq fixpoint unaffected). Real RoPE
        // = stdlib/flame/* + per-module local fns. Reversible. See .verdicts/hexa-0pod/F-OP48-SURVIVE-AUDIT-TRANCHE.txt
        // OP-43 (ML-family): weight_dict deregistered (falsified, 0 shadow, ZERO call-sites repo-wide —
